; colfind_col_out_of_range: a column past the grid extent must raise.
;
; The grid is 2x2, so valid columns are 0 and 1. Column 5 addresses no
; line of the grid: scanning absent coefficients would push -1, so this
; vector pins IndexOutOfBounds.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0

PUSH 2           ; rows
PUSH 2           ; cols
RESIZE r0

PUSH 5           ; col >= cols
PUSH 1           ; value
COLFIND r0
HALT
